# Windows agent installer build inputs -- reproducible via installer/build.ps1 (downloads
# Python's embeddable distribution fresh), no reason to carry ~30MB of extracted vendor
# files in git history. installer/dist/MicroDFIRAgentSetup.exe (the BUILD OUTPUT) is
# checked in on purpose -- it's what the production appliance actually serves, and the
# Linux appliance itself has no way to (re)compile a Windows installer.
installer/vendor/

